<title>NETHERLANDS: TENNIS-KRAJICEK BEATS VACEK IN ROTTERDAM INDOOR FINAL.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-KRAJICEK BEATS VACEK IN ROTTERDAM INDOOR FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-03-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the final in the $750,000 men's Rotterdam World Indoor tennis tournament on Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>2-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands) beat Daniel Vacek (Czech Republic) 7-6 (7-4) 7-6 (7-5)</p>
</text>
